{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"民數記","commonName":"民數記","title":"民數記","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"85178673aa1b8f4f59166e042dd1f8eca3a7c3393527850eb9a97150672c5b13","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":23,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴蘭的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["巴蘭對巴勒說：「你在這裡為我築七座祭壇，預備七頭公牛和七隻公綿羊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["巴勒就照巴蘭的話做了。他們二人在每座壇上獻上一頭公牛和一隻公綿羊，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["巴蘭對巴勒說：「你留在燔祭旁邊，我到前面去，也許耶和華會向我顯現。無論祂有什麼指示，我必告訴你。」巴蘭就上到一處光禿禿的高地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["上帝向巴蘭顯現。巴蘭對上帝說：「我已經預備了七座祭壇，每座祭壇上獻了一頭公牛和一隻公綿羊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華告訴他當說的話，命他回去轉告巴勒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["巴蘭就回到巴勒那裡，看見他和摩押的官長都站在燔祭旁邊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["巴蘭吟詩預言說：",{"text":"「巴勒領我出亞蘭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押王請我出東山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說，『來為我咒詛雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"來斥責以色列！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝沒有咒詛的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能咒詛？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華沒有斥責的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能斥責？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從峰頂觀看他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從高崗眺望他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這獨居一方之民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不與萬國同列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的子孫多如塵土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能數得清？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能數清以色列人的四分之一？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我願像義人一樣死去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如義人般終此一生。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["巴勒對巴蘭說：「你這是做什麼？我請你來咒詛我的仇敵，你竟祝福他們！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["巴蘭說：「耶和華讓我說的話，我豈能不說？」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴蘭第二次預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["巴勒說：「請你跟我去另一個地方，那裡看不見全部以色列人，只能看見一部分，你要在那裡為我咒詛他們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他領巴蘭上到毗斯迦山頂的瑣腓田，在那裡築了七座祭壇，每座壇上都獻了一頭公牛和一隻公綿羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["巴蘭對巴勒說：「你留在這些燔祭旁邊，我到那邊去見耶和華。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和華向巴蘭顯現，告訴他當說的話，讓他轉告巴勒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["巴蘭回到巴勒那裡，看見他和摩押的官長都站在燔祭旁邊。巴勒問道：「耶和華說了什麼？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["巴蘭吟詩預言說：",{"text":"「巴勒啊，要留心聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西撥的兒子啊，請聽我言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝並非世人，祂不撒謊；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝不是凡人，祂不反悔。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂言出必行，信守承諾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我奉命祝福，祂已賜福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不能改變。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的子孫中未見有罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人中看不見有禍患。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的上帝耶和華與他們同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們向自己的君王歡呼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝帶他們出埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂","poem":1},{"noteId":10},{"text":"的力量如野牛之角。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有邪術能害雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有咒語可傷以色列。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"時候一到，人們必談論雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"談論以色列，說，『看啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝的作為何等偉大！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，這民族挺身如母獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"躍起像雄獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不吞食獵物、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不喝獵物的血不躺臥。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["巴勒對巴蘭說：「你可以不咒詛他們，但也不該為他們祝福啊！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["巴蘭回答說：「我不是說過，我必須按耶和華的指示做嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["巴勒說：「來吧，我帶你去另一個地方，也許上帝會同意你在那裡為我咒詛他們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["他領著巴蘭登上俯瞰曠野的毗珥山頂。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["巴蘭對巴勒說：「你在這裡為我築七座祭壇，預備七頭公牛和七隻公綿羊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["巴勒就照巴蘭的話，在每座祭壇上獻了一頭公牛和一隻公綿羊。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"「祂」有古卷作「他們」。","reference":{"chapter":23,"verse":22}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":30}